# Paths left out of `git archive` and so out of GitHub's release zips, which Zenodo archives.
# Zenodo's previewer lists at most 1,000 zip entries (files plus folders); v0.11.0 had 1,010
# and showed "Too many files inside the ZIP file". Everything here stays in the repository.
# tests/test_release_archive.py keeps the count under the limit.
scripts/kaggle/**/kernel-metadata.json export-ignore
docs/results/drafts export-ignore
docs/results/drafts/** export-ignore
